WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=zu.

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.154
Iphrojekthi ye-Arclight.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:05.633
Ungasikhipha kanjani isifo samehlo lapho ukhipha izibuko?

3
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.850
Lapho ukhipha izibuko zamehlo kubalulekile ukungafaki ezinye izifo zamehlo ezicashile.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.084
Ngeshadi le-visual acuity kanye nedivayisi ye-Arclight ungathola ngokushesha ukuthi ubani odingayo

5
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:19.318
izibuko nokuthi hlobo luni futhi ngubani ongadinga ukudluliselwa kwezinye izifo ezifana nolwelwesi lwama-cataract kanye

6
00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:23.552
i-glaucoma.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:30.480
Qala ngokuhlola ukuqonda kokubukwa kwebanga elilodwa ngesikhathi ngaphandle kosizo futhi uma kuncishisiwe sebenzisa imbobo yokukhonkwane.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.520
bese uhlola eduze kokubona ngamehlo womabili ndawonye.

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.920
Ngokuvamile kunemiphumela emihlanu engenzeka.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.400
Uma ibanga eliseduze kokubona kahle lihle kokubili,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.780
isiguli asidingi izibuko.

12
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.160
Uma umbono webanga uncishisiwe,

13
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.920
kodwa ithuthuka ngephinifa futhi umbono oseduze ulungile,

14
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:53.360
khona-ke isiguli sibona kancane kancane, eyaziwa nangokuthi i-myopic.

15
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.920
Uma umbono webanga uncishisiwe kodwa uthuthuka ngephinifa,

16
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.920
nombono oseduze nawo uyancipha,

17
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.920
khona-ke isiguli cishe sibona isikhathi eside,

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.920
eyaziwa nangokuthi i-hyperopia.

19
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
Uma umbono webanga ulungile,

20
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
kodwa umbono oseduze uyancipha,

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.920
futhi isiguli singaphezu kweminyaka engama-40 ubudala,

22
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.920
bese becindezela i-biopia futhi badinga izibuko zokufunda.

23
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.920
Ekugcineni, uma i-acuity ebonakalayo iyancipha

24
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.920
futhi ayithuthuki ngephinifa noma izibuko,

25
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
khona-ke isifo samehlo esingaphansi kungenzeka kakhulu,

26
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.778
isiguli sidinga ukuhlolwa nge-arc light.

27
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:33.270
Iya ekamelweni elinokukhanya kalufifi bese uqala ngokuqondile

28
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.455
inhlamvu yeso ukukhanya reflex.

29
00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:38.010
Bobabili abantu kufanele banciphise ngokulinganayo futhi ngokushesha ekukhanyeni.

30
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.590
Uma bengakwenzi

31
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.386
Ukuqiniswa kahle, kungenzeka kube nesifo se-optic nerve noma i-retina

32
00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.470
ngemuva kwe

33
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.230
iso, njenge-glaucoma noma i-retinal detachment.

34
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.422
Okulandelayo hlola ukuhlolwa kwe-fundal reflex.

35
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:54.710
I-reflex ekhanyayo ye-symmetric isho ukuthi akukho lutho oluvimbile

36
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.730
ukukhanya kungena esweni.

37
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.770
Uma i-reflex iyancipha noma ingekho, khona-ke i-cataract, i-cornea

38
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:05.759
isibazi, igazi ngemuva kweso noma isimila, mhlawumbe esivimba ukukhanya.

39
00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.090
Okulandelayo hlola ingaphambili

40
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.396
yeso, vala ngeluphu yengxenye yangaphambili.

41
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.710
Bheka noma yikuphi ukutheleleka kwe-cornea kanye nezibazi

42
00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.578
noma i-cataract.

43
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:18.782
Ekugcineni, yenza i-optomoscopy eqondile futhi ubheke ngemuva kweso.

44
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:19.650
I-Xammon optic

45
00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
imizwa kanye ne-retina yezimpawu ze-glaucoma, i-thyroid retinopathy, izibazi kanye ne-retinal

46
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.203
iqembu.

47
00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:29.790
Uma kukhona isifo esikhona noma awukwazi ukuthola ukuthi kungani

48
00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.050
ukubona kwesiguli kuhlanzekile, bese wenza uhlelo lokuthi isiguli sibonane nochwepheshe wamehlo.

49
00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.090
Le vidiyo ikhombisa ukuthi ngokuzijwayeza ngokuqeqeshwa okujwayelekile,

50
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.530
abasebenzi bezempilo abajwayelekile, ngisho nangamathuluzi abiza kancane, bangaqonda uma a

51
00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.610
isiguli singahlomula ngezibuko zamehlo noma sidinge ukudluliselwa ukuze silashwe izinkinga ezikhona

52
00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.104
isifo.

53
00:02:47.104 --> 00:02:53.530
Inqubo enamandla enethuluzi elilodwa elibiza kancane noma kuphi emhlabeni nge

54
00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.930
noma ubani.
